<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0707_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tanner</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, how ’bout we swap phone\nnumbers before we eat?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I always got my Pokégear close,\nso if you call me, I’ll answer\fpretty quick!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t trip!\rI’m a REAL nice Camper...\fI just look like I live in the woods.\f’cause I do.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You decide you wanna swap\nnumbers with me after all?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeah! Ayo, here you go!\rI been holdin’ this just for you. Don’t\nbe shy--take it. It’s a present!\fIt smells like smoke. Everything does.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? Oh, you just around the corner?\rIf you that close, why bother with a\nphone call? HUMPH!\fCome sit by the fire.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s fine to be lovey with your homies\nand let ’em live in your crib.\rBut I’d rather go CAMPIN’ with my\nday one, {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}.\fThat’s why it’s so strong!\rWe knocked out a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0},\nWHAMMO! The other day. You shoulda\fseen it... It was dark. I didn’t see it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">About all this trainin’ your homies\njust so you can catch stronger\fwild homies...\rIt ain’t smart to be throwin’\nNap Sacks around reckless, tryna\fcatch any old thing.\rYou gotta build a real bond\nwith your homies.\rMe and my {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} is\na perfect example.\r...Well, I say that, but the other day\nwe had a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} just barely\fget away from us.\rNo matter how much I try not to think\nabout it, I can’t let it go...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hear me out! Earlier, we met a wild\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}!\rIt kinda jumped out while we was\nheadin’ home from a campin’ trip!\fI was SO shook!\rI guess it just show you shouldn’t\nlet your guard down when you out\fin nature!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was gettin’ ready to cook up some\nfood, and I thought about you.\rBefore I sit down to eat, you wanna\nscrap again?\rI’m on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so bring your\nbest homies!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? What’s goin’ on? You get lost\nor somethin’?\rStay calm... I’m RIGHT on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so you shouldn’t\fhave no trouble findin’ me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know the difference between a\npicnic and campin’?\rIt’s the SONG, obviously!\rOn a picnic, you sing a happy lil tune\nwhile you hike.\rWhen you campin’, you sing quiet, SAD\nsongs of grief and loss while starin’\fat the fire.\rWhat? You don’t believe me?\rThen we should go campin’ and see what\nkinda songs you feel like singin’!\fBring tissues.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was diggin’ a fire pit to cook dinner,\nand I found a weird item!\rApparently it’s called a Sun Stone.\fI almost cooked it.\rI’ll give it to you. I’m waitin’ on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0707_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I still got that Sun Stone I said I’d\ngive you!\rI’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so\ncome get it ASAP!</language>
	</row>
</body>
